@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Create order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "products": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get order by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
